  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Thief Arts</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2e/Dota_2_Rubick_Grand_Magus.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241008023220\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Dota 2 Rubick Grand Magus\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2e/Dota_2_Rubick_Grand_Magus.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20241008023220\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2e/Dota_2_Rubick_Grand_Magus.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20241008023220 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2e/Dota_2_Rubick_Grand_Magus.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241008023220 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Dota 2 Rubick Grand Magus\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Dota_2_Rubick_Grand_Magus.gif\" data-image-name=\"Dota 2 Rubick Grand Magus.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Rubick (Dota 2) can use his Spell Steal technique to appropriate his opponent's most recently used spell for himself.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use thief arts.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>utilize practices that are larcenous in nature</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts\" title=\"Supernatural Arts\">Supernatural Arts</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Arts\" title=\"Absorption Arts\">Absorption Arts</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Comics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comics</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThief_Arts%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Larcenous/Larceny/Stealing Arts/Techniques</li>\n<li>Theft/Thievery Arts/Techniques</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThief_Arts%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can utilize the Thief Arts, a specialized system of techniques based around larcenous power. Theft is one of the most common crimes. Normally, this illegal activity results in the physical acquisition of objects. It already requires certain skills to effectively take from others without detection and/or consequence; however, with special training, one can take on unique abilities that go beyond mere appropriation. One could instantly gain mastery over whatever is taken, allowing one to expertly wield it for whatever offensive, defensive or supportive end. Users can take immaterial aspects like memories, souls or superhuman powers or skills from their targets. At the highest levels, one could even claim a victim’s existence, becoming whoever or whatever they wish.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThief_Arts%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Access_Manipulation\" title=\"Access Manipulation\">Access Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Access_%26_Occlusion\" title=\"Access &amp; Occlusion\">Access &amp; Occlusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Openness-Closure_Manipulation\" title=\"Openness-Closure Manipulation\">Openness-Closure Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_Manipulation\" title=\"Aspect Manipulation\">Aspect Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Attribute_Manipulation\" title=\"Attribute Manipulation\">Attribute Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capture_System\" title=\"Capture System\">Capture System</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chameleonic_Nature\" title=\"Chameleonic Nature\">Chameleonic Nature</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Object_Manipulation\" title=\"Object Manipulation\">Object Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Thievery\" title=\"Personal Thievery\">Personal Thievery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Supernatural\">Supernatural Condition</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth/Supernatural\" title=\"Stealth/Supernatural\">Supernatural Stealth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thievery/Supernatural\" title=\"Thievery/Supernatural\">Supernatural Thievery</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tactical_Analysis\" title=\"Tactical Analysis\">Tactical Analysis</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Tactical_Genius\" title=\"Tactical Genius\">Tactical Genius</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thievery_Empowerment\" title=\"Thievery Empowerment\">Thievery Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tracking_Evasion\" title=\"Tracking Evasion\">Tracking Evasion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Trait:Training_Regimen\" title=\"Trait:Training Regimen\">Training Regimen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transmission_Manipulation\" title=\"Transmission Manipulation\">Transmission Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThief_Arts%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Theft_Combat\" title=\"Theft Combat\">Theft Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Theft_Defense\" title=\"Theft Defense\">Theft Defense</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThief_Arts%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thievery_Magic\" title=\"Thievery Magic\">Thievery Magic</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThief_Arts%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Bandit\" title=\"Archetype:Bandit\">Bandit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts\" title=\"Supernatural Arts\">Supernatural Arts</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Arts\" title=\"Absorption Arts\">Absorption Arts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype_Arts\" title=\"Archetype Arts\">Archetype Arts</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Thief\" title=\"Archetype:Thief\">Thief</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thief_Mode\" title=\"Thief Mode\">Thief Mode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Trickster\" title=\"Archetype:Trickster\">Trickster</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThief_Arts%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Absorption\" title=\"Knowledge Absorption\">Knowledge Absorption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Erasure\" title=\"Knowledge Erasure\">Knowledge Erasure</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Law_Inducement\" title=\"Law Inducement\">Law Inducement</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Punishment\" title=\"Punishment\">Punishment</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Theft_Nullification\" title=\"Theft Nullification\">Theft Nullification</a></li>\n<li>May only be applicable against certain targets.</li>\n<li>Lack of proper knowledge could lead to power loss or dangerous effects.</li>\n<li>May be unintentionally overwhelmed and/or possessed thanks to techniques.</li>\n<li>May only be able to steal certain items or aspects.</li>\n<li>May be limited to types of techniques (stealth attacks, power enhancement, aspect acquisition, etc.).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThief_Arts%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://aphorism.fandom.com/wiki/Izuru_Tomonaga\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:aphorism:Izuru Tomonaga\">Izuru Tomonaga</a> (<i>Aphorism</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://charlotte.fandom.com/wiki/Y%C5%AB_Otosaka\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:charlotte:Yū Otosaka\">Yū Otosaka</a> (<i>Charlotte</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dota2.fandom.com/wiki/Rubick\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dota2:Rubick\">Rubick, the Grand Magus</a> (<i>Dota 2</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Faris\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Faris\">Faris/White Wizard</a> (<i>Fairy Tail: 100 Years Quest</i>)</li>\n<li><a